    "copyright": "Piper voice “cadu” (Brazilian Portuguese), from the Piper voices collection, Copyright (c) the Piper voices contributors (MIT).\nIt was taught from recordings a volunteer gave to the public domain (CC0 1.0, https://github.com/OHF-Voice/voice-datasets), starting from a voice that is itself CC0. The model was prepared for this engine by the sherpa-onnx project; Jacket's build stores its weights as 16-bit numbers, which halves its size and changes nothing that can be heard.\nThe sounds it is given to say are written by Jacket's own rules for Brazilian Portuguese."
  },
